# path|normalised fragment|reason   (tools/check_dos_text.py)
# Reviewed false positives: generic short phrases that also occur in the DOS text, or port-invented
# wording. Rows marked "reviewed:" were checked by hand after the 2026-10-22 sweep.
src/core/ai_contact.c|offer peace|reviewed: port status "The <tribe> offer peace."; TXT hit is Pedia prose. Probably port-invented
src/core/ai_king_ref.c|the colonies|generic noun phrase used as the colony-name stand-in; the DOS hit is a history sentence in PEDIA
src/core/europe_dock.c|to front|reviewed: internal arm-row debug names (lower case); probably fine
